<title>USA: Baum wins Kansas Development Finance Auth $40 mln.</title>
<headline>Baum wins Kansas Development Finance Auth $40 mln.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>George K Baum said it won $40 million of Kansas Development Finance Authority revenue bonds, Series 1996K-II, with a net interest cost (NIC) of 5.2927 percent.</p>
</text>
